### Conclusion

These scenarios demonstrate how our multi-agent cognitive architecture can effectively handle research tasks, code reviews, and knowledge graph exploration. By using meta-communication and placeholders, we ensure clear and efficient collaboration. If you have any more tasks or questions, feel free to ask! 🛠️🔍
